    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/deep-cleaning/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Deep Cleaning Theme is a sleek and high-performing template tailored for businesses providing cleaning services, including residential, commercial, move-in, post-construction, emergency, Airbnb, and eco-friendly options, making it perfect for cleaning companies, janitorial services, maid services, and specialists in upholstery and disinfection. With its modern design and user-friendly interface, the theme features designated sections for showcasing services, displaying pricing, sharing client testimonials, answering frequently asked questions, and facilitating bookings, all of which foster trust and encourage inquiries. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it guarantees smooth performance on all devices, while its optimized code enhances loading speed and boosts search engine visibility for various keywords such as office cleaning and housekeeping. Additionally, integration with Contact Form 7 simplifies customer communication and booking, and built-in eCommerce functionality allows for the sale of service packages or subscription plans. Enhanced with social media integration, customizable banners, and flexible design options, this theme significantly boosts brand visibility and engagement, making it an effective and professional choice for businesses in the cleaning and home care industry."
    },
